    "detailed_description": "<strong>HYDROPUNK</strong> is a single-player action-adventure game with an isometric camera, combining a souls-like combat system and emergent mechanics of immersive sims.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785210/extras/0d07a27279d2a69ecefe41ee4b446e0c.poster.avif?t=1705841085\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785210/extras/0d07a27279d2a69ecefe41ee4b446e0c.webm?t=1705841085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785210/extras/0d07a27279d2a69ecefe41ee4b446e0c.mp4?t=1705841085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785210/extras/0ff47346121bf9e35eb1bd5639799ed6.avif?t=1705841085\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>In this world, humanity has built its civilization in the depths of the planet, where an unknown powerful entity lives. The basis of technological progress of mankind here has become <strong>hydraulic machinery</strong>, which is able to work thanks to a special mineral, that increases water in volume through chemical interaction with it.<br><br>The protagonist is a master engineer who <strong><i>must find the source of an unknown disease</i></strong> infecting the environment and whoever survived. He'll have to explore a decaying grimdark world, where every corner can tell a story, and endure battle not only for survival but to save own mind.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785210/extras/7ab2534350956af38600111700e1ae6e.avif?t=1705841085\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Brand New World</strong> is inspired by the Industrial Revolution Era and Lovecraftian Horrors.<br></li><li><strong>Level Design</strong> marries metroidvania and immersive sim principles, complex levels can be completed in various ways.<br></li><li><strong>Combat System</strong> inspired by Souls series and survival horrors - choose your weapons and tools wisely, dodge, roll, parry, look for weaknesses and strike!<br></li><li><strong>Inventive Progression &amp; Craft</strong> - the main asset of our hero is his sharp mind, from various resources you can create equipment that will help in any situation.<br></li><li>The game encourages creativity in solving problems, <strong><i>brute force is rarely the only way</i></strong>.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785210/extras/efb7d0e5e369f8f2e48e6ad3094ef921.poster.avif?t=1705841085\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785210/extras/efb7d0e5e369f8f2e48e6ad3094ef921.webm?t=1705841085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785210/extras/efb7d0e5e369f8f2e48e6ad3094ef921.mp4?t=1705841085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785210/extras/628d6622b205057b631a127abf104ca8.webp?t=1705841085\" width=600 height=50 /></span>",
